<title>UK: Two Jan 17-19 Brents five o'clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Two Jan 17-19 Brents five o'clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both sets of Brent cargo dates nominated on Thursday were left unclaimed at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>Mobil and Phibro were both five o'clocked with January 17-19 loaders, traders said.</p>
<p>Confirmation from the companies was not immediately available.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
